graph TD
    A[Protein Modification Signal] --> B{Modification Type?}
    B -->|Phosphorylation| C[Kinase Recognition]
    B -->|Ubiquitination| D[E3 Ligase]
    B -->|Acetylation| E[Acetyltransferase]
    B -->|Methylation| F[Methyltransferase]
    B -->|Glycosylation| G[Glycosyltransferase]
    
    C --> H[Phosphate Transfer]
    H --> I[Phosphorylated Protein]
    
    D --> J[Ubiquitin Conjugation]
    J --> K[Ubiquitinated Protein]
    
    E --> L[Acetyl Group Transfer]
    L --> M[Acetylated Protein]
    
    F --> N[Methyl Group Transfer]
    N --> O[Methylated Protein]
    
    G --> P[Sugar Addition]
    P --> Q[Glycosylated Protein]
    
    %% Reversal pathways
    I --> R[Phosphatase Activity]
    R --> S[Protein Dephosphorylation]
    
    K --> T[Deubiquitinase]
    T --> U[Protein Deubiquitination]
    
    M --> V[Deacetylase]
    V --> W[Protein Deacetylation]
    
    O --> X[Demethylase]
    X --> Y[Protein Demethylation]
    
    %% Key proteins
    Z[Kinases] --> C
    AA[Phosphatases] --> R
    BB[E3 Ligases] --> D
    CC[Deubiquitinases] --> T
    DD[Acetyltransferases] --> E
    EE[Deacetylases] --> V
    FF[Methyltransferases] --> F
    GG[Demethylases] --> X
    HH[Glycosyltransferases] --> G
    
